    "analysis": {
      "investment_rationale": [
        {
          "institution": "Haatch",
          "speaker": "Fred Soneya",
          "speaker_role": "联合创始人兼普通合伙人",
          "rationale": "Haatch认为AI的最大机会属于在高风险、通用工具不足的垂直市场深耕的公司，私募资本法律工作正是典型；Perry AI不只是审阅文件，而是建立基金每项承诺的持续记忆并据此行动。",
          "quote": "The biggest wins in AI will go to companies that go deep in markets where the stakes are high and generalist tools fall short. Private capital legal work is a textbook example. Shashwat and Vaneesa have spent nearly three decades between them doing this work, and it shows in the product: Perry AI doesn’t just review documents; it builds a living memory of every commitment a fund has made and acts on it",
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-8c91b2ad2ed9b132",
              "quote": "“The biggest wins in AI will go to companies that go deep in markets where the stakes are high and generalist tools fall short. Private capital legal work is a textbook example. Shashwat and Vaneesa have spent nearly three decades between them doing this work, and it shows in the product: Perry AI doesn’t just review documents; it builds a living memory of every commitment a fund has made and acts on it,” said Fred Soneya, co-founder and general partner at Haatch.",
              "source_content_hash": "d191338c232463ba",
              "quote_hash": "e37420ec60e584ba782259572cccee5fc128f1f6e65e33a3a82de7b4d4ac9414"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "institution": "Antler",
          "speaker": "Sarah Finegan",
          "speaker_role": "Associate Partner",
          "rationale": "Antler认为私募资本法律运营是通用软件长期未能服务好的大市场，大量工作仍依赖人工和遗留流程；Perry AI从底层重建该工作流，团队快速将愿景转化为客户影响，因此继续支持其向北美、欧洲和亚洲扩张。",
          "quote": "Private capital legal operations is a huge market that generalist software has never served well, and much of it runs on manual, legacy workflows. Perry AI is rebuilding that work from the ground up. The team has turned their vision into strong traction and real customer impact remarkably quickly, and we’re excited to keep backing them as they expand across North America, Europe and Asia",
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-8c91b2ad2ed9b132",
